{{!--
    Cut regional world…'s foot (S0 step 5, board W7), stacked so neither button wraps in Foundry's
    narrower panel: Cut regional world…, which asks for the new world's name (and to save first, if
    the world has unsaved changes), over Cancel, which goes back to where the cut was opened from.
    Cut is off, with why, with no crop or one finer than a world map can show.
--}}
<div class="fwmb-make-foot fwmb-make-foot--stack">
    <button type="button" class="fwmb-btn" data-action="cancelCut">{{localize "FILRODENSWMB.UI.Cancel"}}</button>
    <button type="button" class="fwmb-btn fwmb-btn--primary" data-action="cutRegionalWorld"{{#if cut.off}} aria-disabled="true" data-tooltip="{{cut.off}}"{{/if}}><span class="fwmb-icon fwmb-icon--crop" aria-hidden="true"></span>{{localize "FILRODENSWMB.UI.CutRegionalWorld"}}</button>
</div>
